name cool
category Package
revision 67013
shortdesc COntent-Oriented LaTeX
relocated 1
longdesc The package (COntent Oriented LaTeX) gives LaTeX the power to
longdesc retain mathematical meaning of its expressions in addition to
longdesc the typsetting instructions; essentially separating style from
longdesc the content of the math. One advantage of keeping mathematical
longdesc meaning is that conversion of LaTeX documents to other
longdesc executable formats (such as Content MathML or Mathematica code)
longdesc is greatly simplified. The package requires the coolstr,
longdesc coollist and forloop packages.
runfiles size=19
 RELOC/tex/latex/cool/cool.sty
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/cool
catalogue-license lgpl
catalogue-topics maths struc-mkup
catalogue-version 1.35
